    "question": "Two loudspeakers *A* and *B* stand $4.0\\ \\mathrm{m}$ apart and play the same tone ($340\\ \\mathrm{Hz}$) in phase. A listener stands $3.0\\ \\mathrm{m}$ from *B* on a line perpendicular to $AB$ (that is, straight ahead of *B*). On which line is the listener standing? Use $v = 340\\ \\mathrm{m/s}$.\n\n<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 380 240\" style=\"display:block;margin:14px auto;max-width:380px;width:100%;height:auto;background:#fafaf5;border:1px solid #d8d1bd;border-radius:4px;font-family:Poppins,sans-serif\"><line x1=\"60\" y1=\"60\" x2=\"60\" y2=\"180\" stroke=\"#1a1d24\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><line x1=\"60\" y1=\"180\" x2=\"150\" y2=\"180\" stroke=\"#1a1d24\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><line x1=\"60\" y1=\"60\" x2=\"150\" y2=\"180\" stroke=\"#c8324a\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-dasharray=\"6 4\"/><polyline points=\"70,180 70,170 60,170\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#5a6172\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><g><circle cx=\"60\" cy=\"60\" r=\"8\" fill=\"#fafaf5\" stroke=\"#1a1d24\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"60\" y=\"64\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"11\" font-weight=\"600\" fill=\"#1a1d24\">A</text></g><g><circle cx=\"60\" cy=\"180\" r=\"8\" fill=\"#fafaf5\" stroke=\"#1a1d24\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"60\" y=\"184\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"11\" font-weight=\"600\" fill=\"#1a1d24\">B</text></g><circle cx=\"150\" cy=\"180\" r=\"4.5\" fill=\"#1a1d24\"/><text x=\"158\" y=\"185\" font-size=\"13\" fill=\"#1a1d24\">listener (L)</text><text x=\"50\" y=\"120\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"#1a1d24\" transform=\"rotate(-90 50 120)\">AB = 4.0 m</text><text x=\"105\" y=\"198\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"#1a1d24\">BL = 3.0 m</text><text x=\"105\" y=\"112\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"#c8324a\">AL</text></svg>",
